  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deep Ground Water</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is  to undertake a comprehensive assessment of the potential for deep groundwater in  Somalia. The primary objective is to undertake an integrated qualitative and quantitative assessment of the potential for deep groundwater in Somalia to support sustainable development and utilization of such resources.Somalia.</narrative>
  </description>
